# NeuroSentry Code Owners
# These owners will be requested for review when someone opens a pull request
# that modifies code that they own.
#
# The last matching pattern takes precedence.
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owners for everything in the repo
*                           @neurosentry/maintainers

# eBPF programs - require security review
/pkg/bpf/                   @neurosentry/maintainers @neurosentry/security
/pkg/bpf/*.c                @neurosentry/maintainers @neurosentry/security

# Security-sensitive code
/pkg/policy/                @neurosentry/maintainers @neurosentry/security
SECURITY.md                 @neurosentry/maintainers @neurosentry/security

# Configuration and deployment
/deploy/                    @neurosentry/maintainers @neurosentry/devops
/deploy/kubernetes/         @neurosentry/maintainers @neurosentry/devops
/.github/                   @neurosentry/maintainers

# Documentation
/docs/                      @neurosentry/maintainers
*.md                        @neurosentry/maintainers

# CI/CD
/.github/workflows/         @neurosentry/maintainers @neurosentry/devops
.golangci.yml               @neurosentry/maintainers
Makefile                    @neurosentry/maintainers

# Go module files
go.mod                      @neurosentry/maintainers
go.sum                      @neurosentry/maintainers
